====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete}} Each of a series of men stationed at specific places along a [[postroad]], with responsibility for [[relay]]ing letters and dispatches of the [[monarch]] (and later others) along the route. {{defdate|16th|17th c.}}
# {{lb|en|dated}} A station, or one of a series of stations, established for the refreshment and accommodation of travellers on some recognized route.
#: {{ux|en|a stage or railway '''post'''}}
# A [[military]] [[base]]; the place at which a soldier or a body of troops is stationed; also, the troops at such a station.
#* {{quote-book
|en
|url=https://archive.org/details/china0000tuan/
|year=1865
|title=Peking and the Pekingese
|volume=II
|author=David Field Rennie, M.D.
